{"strongs": "H2608", "word": "חֲנַנְיָ֫הוּ", "translit": "cha.nan.yah", "root": "חנך", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "hath been gracious", "definition": "חֲנַנְיָ֫הוּ , חֲנַנְיָה proper name, masculine ( ׳ י hath been gracious ) — ᵐ5 Ἀνανίας ; חֲנַנְיָהוּ : (compare חנניהו on Israel. Seal, Ganneau Jas Fev-Mars 1883, 128, No.1 ) — 1. father of a prince under Jehoiakim Jer 36:12 . 2. captain of Uzziah's army 2Chr 26:11 . 3. chief of one of the divisions musicians of David 1Chr 25:23 = חֲנַנְיָה v 1Chr 25:4 . — חֲנַנְיָה : 4. a false prophet of Jeremiah's time Jer 28:1 ; Jer 28:5 ; Jer 28:10 ; Jer 28:11 ; Jer 28:12 ; Jer 28:13 ; Jer 28:15 (twice in verse); Jer 28:17 . 5. one of the three companions of Daniel Dan 1:6 ; Dan 1:7 ; Dan 1:11 ; Dan 1:19 . 6. grandfather of an officer of the guard in Jeremiah's time Jer 37:13 . 7. a son of Zerubbabel 1Chr 3:19 ; 1Chr 3:21 . 8. a Benjamite 1Chr 8:24 . 9. various post-exilic persons. \\ \\ a. Ezra 10:28 . \\ \\ b. Neh 3:8 . \\ \\ c. Neh 3:30 . \\ \\ d. Neh 7:2 . \\ \\ e. Neh 10:24 . feminine Neh 12:12 ; Neh 12:41 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2951')\">BDB2951</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2608')\">H2608</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2950')\">BDB2950</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2952')\">BDB2952</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>חֲנַנְיָ֫הוּ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>חֲנַנְיָה</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <highlight>hath been gracious</highlight>) — <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ἀνανίας</grk>; <bdbheb>חֲנַנְיָהוּ</bdbheb>: (compare <bdbheb>חנניהו</bdbheb> on Israel. Seal, Ganneau<sup>Jas Fev-Mars 1883, 128, No.1</sup>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> father of a prince under Jehoiakim <ref ref=\"Jer 36:12\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(24,36,12)\">Jer 36:12</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> captain of Uzziah's army <ref ref=\"2Chr 26:11\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,26,11)\">2Chr 26:11</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> chief of one of the divisions musicians of David <ref ref=\"1Chr 25:23\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(13,25,23)\">1Chr 25:23</ref> = <bdbheb>חֲנַנְיָה</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"1Chr 25:4\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(13,25,4)\">1Chr 25:4</ref>. — <bdbheb>חֲנַנְיָה</bdbheb>: </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> a false prophet of Jeremiah's time <ref ref=\"Jer 28:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,28,1)\">Jer 28:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 28:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,28,5)\">Jer 28:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 28:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,28,10)\">Jer 28:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 28:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,28,11)\">Jer 28:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 28:12\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(24,28,12)\">Jer 28:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 28:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,28,13)\">Jer 28:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 28:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,28,15)\">Jer 28:15</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Jer 28:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,28,17)\">Jer 28:17</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> one of the three companions of Daniel <ref ref=\"Dan 1:6\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(27,1,6)\">Dan 1:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 1:7\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(27,1,7)\">Dan 1:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 1:11\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(27,1,11)\">Dan 1:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 1:19\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(27,1,19)\">Dan 1:19</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> grandfather of an officer of the guard in Jeremiah's time <ref ref=\"Jer 37:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,37,13)\">Jer 37:13</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>7.</b> a son of Zerubbabel <ref ref=\"1Chr 3:19\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(13,3,19)\">1Chr 3:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 3:21\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(13,3,21)\">1Chr 3:21</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>8.</b> a Benjamite <ref ref=\"1Chr 8:24\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(13,8,24)\">1Chr 8:24</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>9.</b> various post-exilic persons. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:28\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,28)\">Ezra 10:28</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 3:8\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,8)\">Neh 3:8</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 3:30\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,30)\">Neh 3:30</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 7:2\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,2)\">Neh 7:2</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 10:24\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,24)\">Neh 10:24</ref>. <b>feminine</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 12:12\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,12)\">Neh 12:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 12:41\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,4